---
import {t,asset,type Lang} from '../config';
import {team} from '../data/team';
const {lang}=Astro.props as {lang:Lang};
---
<nav class="wrap about-jump" aria-label={t(lang,['关于我们页内导航','About page sections'])}><a href="#team">{t(lang,['认识团队','Meet the team'])} ↗</a><a href="#founders-letter">{t(lang,['创始人信','A letter from the founder'])} ↗</a></nav>
<section class="section wrap" id="team"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE MARK OF THINKING</span><h2>{t(lang,['一起设计课程，\n一起构建学习工具。','Educators, researchers\nand builders.'])}</h2></div><p>{t(lang,['团队的经历跨越教育学、心理学、社会学、语言学与工程。我们把课程设计、学习研究与产品开发放在一起，讨论学生需要怎样的支持。','Our backgrounds span education, psychology, sociology, linguistics and engineering. We bring curriculum design, learning research and product development together to consider the support students need.'])}</p></div><div class="people-grid">{team.map((person,i)=><article class={`person ${i<2?'person-founder':''}`}><div class="person-photo">{person.photo?<img src={asset(person.photo)} width="1200" height="1200" loading="lazy" alt={t(lang,person.name)}/>:<span aria-hidden="true">{t(lang,person.initial)}</span>}</div><div class="person-copy"><span class="eyebrow">{t(lang,person.role)}</span><h3>{t(lang,person.name)}</h3><p>{t(lang,person.bio)}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section founders-letter" id="founders-letter"><div class="wrap letter-layout"><aside><span class="eyebrow">A NOTE FROM OUR FOUNDER</span><h2>{t(lang,['创始人信','A letter from\nthe founder'])}</h2><p>{t(lang,['陈玉洁','Yujie Chen'])}</p></aside><div class="letter-paper">
<p class="letter-greeting">{t(lang,['致关心学生成长的教育工作者：','Dear educators,'])}</p>
<p>{t(lang,['在媒介与信息素养、可持续发展教育和 AI 课程设计的工作中，我持续思考一个问题：当 AI 能够提供越来越多答案，学生需要学会什么？跨越不同国家、文化与教育体系的课程协作经历，让我尤其关注学生如何理解信息、作出判断，以及把想法付诸行动。','Through my work in media and information literacy, education for sustainable development and AI curriculum design, I keep returning to one question: as AI provides more answers, what do students need to learn? Collaborating across countries, cultures and education systems has made me particularly interested in how students understand information, make judgments and put ideas into practice.'])}</p>
<p>{t(lang,['我希望学生能够追问一个说法的来源，解释自己为什么接受一条证据，也愿意在遇到反例时修改判断。这些能力需要在具体任务中反复练习：读一篇文章、发展一段论证、开展一次调查，或完成一个自己关心的项目。','I want students to question where a claim comes from, explain why they accept a piece of evidence and be willing to revise a judgment when they encounter a counterexample. Those abilities take practice through concrete tasks: reading an article, developing an argument, conducting an investigation or pursuing a project they care about.'])}</p>
<p>{t(lang,['思维印记把课程、交互式思维工具和 AI 支持放进这些学习过程。学生可以获得问题、方法和反馈，也需要自己作出选择、撰写作业正文、检查与修改成果。我在参与产品设计时反复考虑的是：怎样的支持，能让学生更有能力完成下一次思考？','The Mark of Thinking brings courses, interactive thinking tools and AI support into these learning processes. Students can draw on questions, methods and feedback while making their own choices, writing their own assignments, and reviewing and revising their work. A question I return to in designing the product is: what support will leave a student better equipped for the next task?'])}</p>
<p>{t(lang,['我也希望教师能更具体地了解学习如何发生。学生怎样使用信息，在哪一步改变了主意，AI 参与了哪些工作，都值得被回顾。学习记录与过程评估为这些讨论提供依据，教师结合课堂观察和对学生的了解，决定下一步如何指导。','I also want educators to have a clearer view of how learning happens. How students use information, where they change their minds and how AI contributes are all worth revisiting. Learning records and process assessment give those conversations a concrete starting point. Educators bring their classroom observations and knowledge of their students to deciding what guidance comes next.'])}</p>
<p>{t(lang,['这是我做思维印记的出发点。我期待与学校和教育工作者一起，把它用于真实的学习任务，认真听取师生的反馈，持续改进学生获得的支持。','This is why I am building The Mark of Thinking. I look forward to working with schools and educators on real learning tasks, listening carefully to students and teachers, and improving the support students receive.'])}</p>
<div class="letter-signature">{t(lang,['陈玉洁','Yujie Chen'])}<span>{t(lang,['思维印记创始人','Founder, The Mark of Thinking'])}</span></div></div></div></section>
